


### 1. TEST TASK 77: INFRASTRUCTURE (RFID CARDS)

# API Import danh sách thẻ từ file CSV
# Lưu ý: Postman/Swagger dễ test upload file hơn,
# nhưng đây là cách gọi HTTP cơ bản.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/infrastructure/cards/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cards.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./cards.csv
--boundary--

### Lấy danh sách tất cả thẻ
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/infrastructure/cards
Accept: application/json

### Cập nhật trạng thái thẻ (Ví dụ: Khóa thẻ UID 123)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/infrastructure/cards/123/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}


### 2. TEST TASK 76: FINANCE (PAYMENT)

### Tạo đơn thanh toán (Ví dụ: Thanh toán PayPal)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/finance/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50000,
  "providerCode": "PAYPAL"
}

### Kiểm tra đơn hàng thanh toán (Nếu có API capture)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/finance/payments/capture?token=abc-xyz-token-test
Accept: application/json

### Xem doanh thu tổng (Revenue Dashboard)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/finance/revenue/daily
Accept: application/json